# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app needs NO environment variables to run. Data is read from static JSON
# under data/seed/, so it builds and deploys with zero configuration and holds
# no secrets.
#
# This file exists to document that fact and to reserve names for likely future
# integrations. Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) only if you add one of these.
#
# The app itself still needs NO env vars. The variable below is used ONLY by the
# data-ingestion script (`npm run ingest:cfbd`, TICKET-6) — not by the deployed app.
#
# CFBD_API_KEY — CollegeFootballData API v2 key. v2 requires a key (Bearer auth).
# Free tier = 1k calls/mo (3k with an .edu email): https://collegefootballdata.com/key
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and fill it in to run the ingestion.
CFBD_API_KEY=

# Reserved for a future NIL data integration (not currently used).
# NIL_DATA_API_KEY=
